drawDB Collaborative

This program is a modified version of drawDB
(https://github.com/drawdb-io/drawdb), by way of
https://github.com/yms2772/drawdb (real-time collaboration and server storage)
and https://github.com/artempas/drawdb-collaborative-with-auth (accounts and
Git sync). Like them, it is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3 (see LICENSE).

Modifications in this version (2026), as required by section 5(a) of the
licence; the Git history records each change and its date:

- Self-hosting without Internet access: no analytics, CDNs, embedded third-
  party content or external links; source code and third-party licences are
  served by the instance itself (/source, /third-party-licenses.txt).
- New SQL export for MySQL, MariaDB, PostgreSQL, SQLite, SQL Server and
  Oracle, with documented settings and a review of problems before export.
- Protobuf export with stable field numbers and reserved fields.
- Security hardening: setup code for the first account, stronger password
  hashing, login throttling per address, Content Security Policy, isolation of
  the Git sync (credentials, symbolic links, allowed hosts), hardened
  container.
- Spanish translation completed.

The licences of the third-party libraries included in the program are
listed in dist/third-party-licenses.txt, generated at build time.
